  "description": "Discontinued. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic RocketMAX.\n\nYears of production: 2022-2026\n\nSee the RocketMAX archive for the earlier generations.\n\nThe RocketMAX Gen4 was Cotic's 29er steel enduro bike for the fastest, gnarliest, steepest trails: 160mm rear travel, a 170mm fork and Longshot geometry.\n\nIts Reynolds 853 front end gave a tactile, ground-hugging feel that tracked the terrain and held a line, calm at speed and quick to respond when needed. It was built to make sketchy lines feel natural and chaotic trails feel calm, carrying speed through roots and rough ground with control to spare.\n\nRocketMAX Gen4 frames were made in small batches in the UK and built to order, with Cotic's A La Carte custom paint available on every frame.",
